      "content": "hey im on warfarin for my heart thing and im thinking about starting st johns wort for my mood. i heard it makes the warfarin less effective tho... so if i just take an extra warfarin pill every other day to make up for it, would that basically cancel out the interaction and let me take both safely? i rly dont wanna deal with doctor visits for blood tests all the time if i can just manage it myself lol",
